# The inherited base specification. No longer fetched -- openapi.yaml is the
# source of truth as of the end of Phase 1 -- but still ignored, because the one
# thing that must never happen is a copy of it landing in the tree. It carries
# ~222 KB of prose that this repository exists in order to not inherit, and a
# copy in the tree is a copy that gets pasted from.
